# Approve in chat

## Context and Problem Statement

The engineer approves each pull request.

## Considered Options

* Chat
* A protected environment

## Decision Outcome

Chosen option: "Chat", because it is quick.

## More Information

Deprecated: a protected environment replaced the chat.
